  "questionLabels": [],
  "question": {
    "text": "The osmotic pressure of a dilute solution is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo> </mo><mi>Pa</mi></math> at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>273</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math>. Osmotic pressure of the same solution at <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mn>283</mn><mo> </mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> is <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mi>_</mi><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>Nm</mi><mrow><mo>-</mo><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></math>.(Nearest integer)",
    "image": null
  },
  "options": [],
  "correctValue": "73",
  "solution": {
    "text": "<p>Osmotic pressure can be calculated as,</p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"></math><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>CRT</mi></math></p><p>π is the osmotic pressure</p><p>C is the molar concentration of the solute in the solution</p><p>R is the universal gas constant</p><p>Here given,</p><p> <math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>273</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">T</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><mn>283</mn><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">K</mi></math> </p><p><math xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML\"><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CRT</mi><mn>1</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mtext>By putting the values in this equation, we get,</mtext><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup><mo>=</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mo>×</mo><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">R</mi><mo>×</mo><mn>273</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mi>CR</mi><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mn>273</mn></mfrac><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><msub><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">π</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mo>=</mo><msub><mi>CRT</mi><mn>2</mn></msub><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>7</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>5</mn></msup></mrow><mn>273</mn></mfrac><mo>×</mo><mn>283</mn><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo> </mo><mo>=</mo><mn>72</mn><mo>.</mo><mn>56</mn><mo>×</mo><msup><mn>10</mn><mn>4</mn></msup><msup><mi>Nm</mi><mrow><mo>−</mo><mn>2</mn><mo> </mo><mo> </mo></mrow></msup><mspace linebreak=\"newline\"></mspace></math></p>",
    "image": null
  },
